<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Corpgro buys Lowveld Building Supplies.</title>
<headline>Corpgro buys Lowveld Building Supplies.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corpgro Ltd said on Thursday its unit Corpbuild had bought Lowveld Building Supplies with effect from July 1, 1996 for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Lowveld Building Supplies is a retailer and distributor of building supplies in a wide range of locations, including Gauteng, Western Cape, KwaZulu-Natal and North West Province.</p>
<p>Corpgro said the acquisition was in line with Corpbuild's strategy of expanding its operations into high growth markets.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
